# Contributor: waydroid-bluetooth
# Maintainer: waydroid-bluetooth
pkgname=waydroid-bt-host
pkgver=0.1.0
pkgrel=0
pkgdesc="Host bridge: Waydroid Bluetooth backend over BlueZ"
url="https://github.com/isyourbrainfoss/waydroid-host-stack"
arch="all"
license="MIT"
depends="bluez dbus"
makedepends="cargo rust protobuf-dev dbus-dev pkgconf"
source=""
builddir="$srcdir/waydroid-bluetooth"

# When packaging from git:
# source="waydroid-bluetooth-$pkgver.tar.gz::https://..."
# Or use abuild with options="net" and cargo fetch in prepare().

build() {
	# Expect builddir to be the monorepo root (adjust for your source layout).
	cargo build --release --locked -p waydroid-bt-host || \
		cargo build --release -p waydroid-bt-host
}

check() {
	cargo test --workspace --release || cargo test --workspace
}

package() {
	install -Dm755 target/release/waydroid-bt-host \
		"$pkgdir"/usr/bin/waydroid-bt-host
	install -Dm644 host/systemd/waydroid-bt-host.service \
		"$pkgdir"/usr/lib/systemd/system/waydroid-bt-host.service
}
